Synthetic OPM-MEG dataset
=========================

Every file here was generated by `src/custom/make_synthetic.py`.
There is no human data: the anatomy is an analytic phantom and the
recordings are simulated through a BEM forward model.

Subjects: 001
Task: synth | session: 01 | 144 magnetometers at 200 Hz

Ground-truth source positions and the planted artifacts are recorded
in ground_truth.json.
